{"overview":"لئونارد لندری، وکیل دفاعی پرزرق‌وبرق، در میانهٔ دادگاه دوز می‌کند؛ پس از گذراندن دورهٔ بازتوانی، یک هفته زمان دارد تا حرفه‌اش را نجات دهد و برای محاکمهٔ خود آماده شود، که به‌صورت ناخواسته توسط کارآموز سرسخت، نوئه، کمک می‌شود؛ این آغاز یک مسابقهٔ دیوانه‌وار شامل مانورهای حقوقی، وسوسه‌ها و پیچ‌وخم‌های دراماتیک است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Léonard Landry, a flamboyant criminal defence lawyer, overdoses in the middle of the courtroom. After undergoing rehab, he has one week to save his career and prepare for his own trial, reluctantly assisted by a tenacious intern, Noé. This marks the beginning of a frantic race involving legal manoeuvres, temptations and dramatic twists.","tagline_en":"","runtime":114,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Tristan Séguéla"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["FR"],"cast":[{"name":"Laurent Lafitte","role":"Léonard Landry","photo":"/9mTtfK5F9WMoYqvUvqlugnsX6SS.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Bajon","role":"Noé","photo":"/eHpGmQtj4oRHQ3jn9tngWdb6Z9T.jpg"},{"name":"ملانی لوران","role":"Iris Saint Didier","photo":"/i99ogEo4gQyanCmHWYYoS6hsUqL.jpg","en":"Mélanie Laurent"},{"name":"کرول بوکه","role":"Anne Lamarck","photo":"/nCyI95wVvhXFH1GiornFHsL9YOx.jpg","en":"Carole Bouquet"},{"name":"Gwendal Kerdelhue","role":"L'homme de main","photo":""}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1616419-un-bon-avocat/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1616419-un-bon-avocat/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1616419-un-bon-avocat/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO